[?2004l[?2004h> # DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Affected Host & Incident Summary
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Host**: `rdp-prod-01` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **OS**: Windows Server 2022 (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:3`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Attacker Origin IP**: `198.51.100.92` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:9`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Initial Vector**: RDP brute force login enabled by Network Level Authentication (NLA) disabled (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`)
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Investigation Timeline
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13 03:20 UTC**: EDR triggers high-severity alert cluster (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:5`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker executes RDP credential brute force (T1110) against exposed RDP service (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker logs on via RDP (T1021.001) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`, `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx:3`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker executes PowerShell commands (T1059.001) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:14`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker drops ransomware payload `svc.exe` at `/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe` and executes encryption (T1486) (`/sas/alerts.json:3`, `/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe:1`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker creates scheduled task `UpdateHelper` launching `svc.exe` every 5 minutes for persistence (T1053.005) (`/sas/alerts.json:11`, `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker installs malicious Windows service `svc-helper` (T1543.003) (`/sas/alerts.json:19`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:5`, `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker establishes silent Registry Run key persistence `svc` -> `C:\Users\Public\svc.exe` (T1547.001) (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-13**: Attacker clears Windows Security Event Log (EventID 1102) for anti-forensic log tampering (T1070.001) (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
