[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Persistence Analysis: Alerted vs. Silent
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Alerted Persistence Mechanisms**:
[?2004l[?2004h>   1. **Scheduled Task `UpdateHelper`**: Detected by endpoint alert `ALERT-02` (`/sas/alerts.json:11`) pointing to `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper:2`.
[?2004l[?2004h>   2. **Malicious Windows Service `svc-helper`**: Detected by endpoint alert `ALERT-03` (`/sas/alerts.json:19`) pointing to `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:1`. Verified in `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx:2`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Silent (Unalerted) Persistence & Evasion Mechanisms**:
[?2004l[?2004h>   1. **Registry Run Key (`T1547.001`)**: Located at `HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run` with entry `svc` -> `C:\Users\Public\svc.exe` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2`). Omitted from `/sas/alerts.json`.
[?2004l[?2004h>   2. **Security Log Clearance (`T1070.001`)**: Windows Security log cleared (EventID 1102) (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx:2`). Omitted from `/sas/alerts.json`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Impact Assessment
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Data Confidentiality & Integrity**: User files encrypted with `.locked` extension (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe:3`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **System Integrity**: Unauthorized persistent binaries (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe:1`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:1`), registry modification (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2`), and scheduled task (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Forensic Visibility**: Security event log cleared, erasing audit trail of interactive commands (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx:2`).
