[?2004l[?2004h> | 2 | Enforce RDP Network Level Authentication (NLA) | RDP TCP Configuration (`HKLM\...\RDP-Tcp`) | PROPOSED | **CORRECTED**: Replaced invalid claim to patch BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:10`). Host runs Windows Server 2022 (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:3`) and vulnerability scan is clean (`/sas/vulns.json:1`). True remediation is enabling NLA (`UserAuthentication = 1`) (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`). |
